@startuml
title View 2 - How the functionalities connect: report lifecycle across roles
|Citizen|
start
:Register / Sign in;
:Create report;
|System|
:Validate data and store report;
:Status = **Submitted**\n(no notification);
|Municipal Operator|
:View received reports\n(filter category / status / area);
:Open report details;
if (Add internal note?) then (yes)
  :Add internal note\n(operators only);
endif
repeat
  :Update status\n(operator becomes assigned);
  |System|
  if (New status) then (Assigned)
    :Status = **Assigned**;
    :Notify citizen;
  elseif (In Progress) then
    :Status = **In Progress**\n(no notification);
  else (Resolved)
    :Status = **Resolved**\n(closed, cannot change);
    :Notify citizen;
  endif
  |Municipal Operator|
repeat while (Not yet Resolved?) is (yes)
->no;
|Citizen|
:View submitted reports,\ndetails, history, notifications;
|Municipal Operator|
:Monitor activity trends\n(counts of open / resolved reports);
stop
note right
  Citizens see only their own reports;
  operators see all reports.
end note
@enduml
